#. module: bf_school_record
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_school_record.field_bf_school_record__state
msgid "A file is kept after the student leaves."
msgstr "Le dossier est conservé après le départ de l'élève."

#. module: bf_school_record
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_school_record/models/ir_attachment.py:0
msgid "A file kept with a student's file is not replaced or deleted from here: it changes by the screen or the button of its record, which keep a trace."
msgstr "Un fichier conservé avec le dossier d'un élève ne se remplace ni ne se supprime d'ici : il change par l'écran ou le bouton de sa fiche, qui en gardent une trace."

#. module: bf_school_record
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_school_record/models/record_type.py:0
msgid "A kind of piece belongs to one of your companies."
msgstr "Un type de pièce appartient à l'une de vos sociétés."

#. module: bf_school_record
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:bf_school_record.constraint_bf_school_record_type_code_unique
msgid "A kind of piece has its own code."
msgstr "Chaque type de pièce a son propre code."

#. module: bf_school_record
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_school_record/models/transfer.py:0
msgid "A prepared or sent transfer is kept: it is part of the file's history."
msgstr "Un transfert préparé ou envoyé est conservé : il fait partie de l'historique du dossier."

#. module: bf_school_record
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_school_record/models/transfer.py:0
msgid "A prepared transfer is not edited: the package was made for what it says."
msgstr "Un transfert préparé ne se modifie pas : le paquet a été fait pour ce qu'il dit."

#. module: bf_school_record
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:bf_school_record.constraint_bf_school_record_student_school_unique
msgid "A student has one file per school."
msgstr "Chaque élève a un seul dossier par école."

#. module: bf_school_record
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_school_record/models/record.py:0
msgid "A student's file is not deleted: the regulation makes the school keep it, and hand it to the Minister if the school closes. Close it with the student's departure."
msgstr "Le dossier d'un élève ne se supprime pas : le règlement oblige l'école à le conserver et à le remettre au Ministère si elle ferme. Fermez-le plutôt avec le bouton « Départ de l'élève »."

#. module: bf_school_record
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_school_record/models/transfer.py:0
msgid "A transfer that was sent is kept as it went."
msgstr "Un transfert envoyé est conservé tel quel."

#. module: bf_school_record
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_school_record/models/transfer.py:0
msgid "A transfer's state and package move with the buttons."
msgstr "L'état et le paquet d'un transfert ne changent que par ses boutons."

